# Plugin and marketplace bump

Any PR that changes this repo's tools, skills, server behavior, or shipped plugin package **must** bump `solstice-platform` in the same PR. Cursor/Claude marketplaces pin a version; leaving it unchanged means clients keep the old package.

Patch bump (`0.3.25` → `0.3.26`) for behavior/skill/tool changes. Minor if you break the plugin contract.

## Files (lockstep)

Set the same version in all of these:

- `plugins/solstice-platform/.cursor-plugin/plugin.json`
- `plugins/solstice-platform/.claude-plugin/plugin.json`
- `plugins/solstice-platform/.codex-plugin/plugin.json`
- `.cursor-plugin/marketplace.json`
- `.claude-plugin/marketplace.json`
- `tests/test_plugin_package.py` (`PLUGIN_VERSION`)

`.agents/plugins/marketplace.json` has no version field. Do not invent one.

`test_host_manifests_and_catalogs_stay_aligned` fails if any of those drift.

## Skip

CI-only, README outside the plugin, or a PR that is already only the bump.

Commit message shape: `chore(plugin): bump solstice-platform to 0.3.26`
